  - question: "Kolondaki \xE7atlak ne kadar derin?"
    answer: "G\xF6r\xFCnen k\u0131sm\u0131 ince. \u0130\xE7ini kim g\xF6recek?"
  - question: "M\xFChendis g\xF6rd\xFC m\xFC?"
    answer: "G\xF6rd\xFC, 'olur' dedi. Yaz\u0131l\u0131 de\u011Fil ama."
  approvedLine: "Kirac\u0131lara m\xFCjde, sa\u011F olun!"
